    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$1.74 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for a donburi that Japanese restaurants serve for $13. The chicken-and-egg combo is one of the cheapest high-protein pairings in the entire grocery store, and this dish was built around it.",
